ted my toothpaste.  Must have been the excess in flouride!  Sigh!... The absurdity of this Chinese fire drill of meaninglessness brought my blood to a boil.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6339691667959369339/comments/default/8021998443460232875'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6339691667959369339/comments/default/8021998443460232875'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/11/daedalus-shrugged-mounting-resistance.html?showComment=1289839385758#c8021998443460232875' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/11/daedalus-shrugged-mounting-resistance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6339691667959369339' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6339691667959369339' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 15, 2010 at 9:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2678958609066768803</id><published>2010-11-15T09:31:32.441-07:00</published><updated>2010-11-15T09:31:32.441-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Tony, you just shook loose a thought inside my nog...</title><content type='html'>Tony, you just shook loose a thought inside my noggin.  I remember long ago someone telling me that there is a sex offender registry, where even innocent people can and do get posted on.  The fact that actual offenders manage to slither into being TSA goons makes me wonder if that body can&amp;#39;t be sued for negligence.  If they can&amp;#39;t even do a proper background on someone who ostensibly is there to &amp;quot;protect&amp;quot; you then just what in the hell are they doing there?  Of course that&amp;#39;s a rhetorical question.  Liberanter put a smile on my face when he says that the place one fellow worked at, USAID, was &amp;quot;touchy-feely&amp;quot;.  Not touchy &amp;amp; feely enough it appears!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6339691667959369339/comments/default/2678958609066768803'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6339691667959369339/comments/default/2678958609066768803'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/11/daedalus-shrugged-mounting-resistance.html?showComment=1289838692441#c2678958609066768803' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/11/daedalus-shrugged-mounting-resistance.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6339691667959369339' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6339691667959369339' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 15, 2010 at 9:31 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3102405175279372220</id><published>2010-11-15T07:38:01.091-07:00</published><updated>2010-11-15T07:38:01.091-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I thought people were joking when they said that t...</title><conten